  "tekken": {
    "title": "TEKKEN",
    "subtitle": "OFFICIAL 1V1 IRON FIST FIGHTING CHAMPIONSHIP RULEBOOK",
    "html": "\n    <div class=\"rb-section\">\n      <div class=\"rb-section-header\">\n        <span class=\"rb-section-tag\">OVERVIEW</span>\n        <h4 class=\"rb-section-title\">ABOUT THE EVENT</h4>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"rb-paragraph\">The <strong>Tekken LAN Event 2026</strong> is a live, in-person tournament aimed at showcasing top-tier competitive fighting talent in Tekken at JECRC University.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"rb-section\">\n      <div class=\"rb-section-header\">\n        <span class=\"rb-section-tag\">TEAMS</span>\n        <h4 class=\"rb-section-title\">TEAM SPECIFICATION</h4>\n      </div>\n      <ul class=\"rb-list\">\n        <li><span><strong>Roster Size:</strong> Solo competition (strictly 1 participant per registration).</span></li>\n        <li><span><strong>Targeted Competitors:</strong> 150 registered fighters competing live.</span></li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"rb-section\">\n      <div class=\"rb-section-header\">\n        <span class=\"rb-section-tag\">FORMAT</span>\n        <h4 class=\"rb-section-title\">MATCH FORMAT & BRACKET</h4>\n      </div>\n      <ul class=\"rb-list\">\n        <li><span><strong>Double Elimination:</strong> The tournament utilizes a strict Double-Elimination bracket (Winner's & Loser's brackets).</span></li>\n        <li><span><strong>Match Length:</strong> All matches except for the finals are Best-of-One (BO1) games.</span></li>\n        <li><span><strong>Finals:</strong> Grand Finals will be Best-of-Three (BO3) games.</span></li>\n        <li><span><strong>Bracket Reset:</strong> The Grand Final will reset if the player from the Loser's bracket wins the first set.</span></li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"rb-section\">\n      <div class=\"rb-section-header\">\n        <span class=\"rb-section-tag\">RULES</span>\n        <h4 class=\"rb-section-title\">RULES AND REGULATIONS</h4>\n      </div>\n      <ol class=\"rb-numbered-list\">\n        <li><span><strong>Stage Selection:</strong> If players choose not to rematch on the same stage, the next stage must be selected randomly. Certain stages may be banned by tournament officials for competitive fairness.</span></li>\n        <li><span><strong>Character Lock:</strong> The winner of a game must keep their character; the loser is permitted to switch characters for the next game.</span></li>\n        <li><span><strong>Roster & DLC:</strong> All characters, including DLC characters, are allowed unless explicitly banned by staff.</span></li>\n        <li><span><strong>Customization Policy:</strong> Character customization must remain strictly OFF during tournament matches.</span></li>\n        <li><span><strong>Combat Integrity:</strong> Spamming uncompetitive power moves is prohibited.</span></li>\n        <li><span><strong>Dispute Resolution:</strong> All disputes must be raised immediately with tournament staff. The decision of the staff is final and binding.</span></li>\n      </ol>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"rb-section\">\n      <div class=\"rb-section-header\">\n        <span class=\"rb-section-tag\">PRIZE</span>\n        <h4 class=\"rb-section-title\">PRIZE POOL & CERTIFICATION</h4>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rb-specs-grid\">\n        <div class=\"rb-spec-item\"><span class=\"rb-spec-key\">EXPECTED PRIZE POOL</span><span class=\"rb-spec-val\">₹20,000</span></div>\n        <div class=\"rb-spec-item\"><span class=\"rb-spec-key\">COMPETITION MODE</span><span class=\"rb-spec-val\">OFFLINE 1V1 LAN</span></div>\n        <div class=\"rb-spec-item\"><span class=\"rb-spec-key\">BRACKET TYPE</span><span class=\"rb-spec-val\">DOUBLE ELIMINATION</span></div>\n        <div class=\"rb-spec-item\"><span class=\"rb-spec-key\">FINALS FORMAT</span><span class=\"rb-spec-val\">BO3 WITH BRACKET RESET</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rb-motto-box\">\n        <span class=\"rb-motto-text\">ENTER THE ARENA. CLAIM THE IRON FIST.</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    "
  }
